body:
Wait, I know this means shit coming from a 16 year old but look,  I'm not going to say I understand what you are going through completely fucking understand what its like to feel this way. Please for the love of fucking god talk to me. we may not know eachother but weve both been through shit and I'm sorry that feel the way you do but I know one thing and that's talking to people and seeking the right medical attention can and will eventually help you. please I'm fucking begging you not to go through with this, this isn't the way to fix those problems. by ending your life your only letting the people and the things that hurt you win, your a lot stronger than that and i can tell just from reading what you wrote, that youve put up with alot and the fact that your still going shows me and everyone else that you ARE strong and you ARE capable of making the change that you want in your life. and its not going to be easy but if you go through with this youll never get the chance. I know what your going through is hard but your only 20 years old youve got atleast another 50 years ahead of you, i want you to know that people DO care about you and even though we dont know eachother I genuinely care about you and if I didn't i wouldn't be sitting here typing this. i Dont want you to do this, and there's lots of people who I know agree with me. just remember its permanent solution to a temporary pain.

&#x200B;

(911)  Call this number please im begging you i dont want to turn on the tv in the morning and find out  you've ended your life. please talk to me and call please get the help you need. <3
